! width=200px | Singular
! width=200px | Plural
|-
| Nominative || {{lang|ga|bád}} {{IPA|/bˠaːd̪ˠ/}} || {{lang|ga|báid}} {{IPA|/bˠaːdʲ/}}
|-
| Vocative || {{lang|ga|a bháid}} {{IPA|/ə waːdʲ/}} || {{lang|ga|a bháda}} {{IPA|/ə waːd̪ˠə/}}
|-
| Genitive || {{lang|ga|báid}} {{IPA|/bˠaːdʲ/}} || {{lang|ga|bád}} {{IPA|/bˠaːd̪ˠ/}}
|-
| Dative || {{lang|ga|bád}} {{IPA|/bˠaːd̪ˠ/}} || {{lang|ga|báid}} (''obsolete'' {{lang|ga|bádaibh}})
|}

