*{{IPA|/x/}} > {{IPA|/ç/}} > {{IPA|/j/}}. The resulting {{IPA|/əj/}} is written -{{vr|(a)igh}} and is pronounced {{IPA|/iː/}}, {{IPA|/ə/}}, or {{IPA|/əɟ/}}, depending on dialect.
